{"id":"639761","name":"蔓越莓米发糕","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/639761/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"发糕粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"蔓越莓干","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"180g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买的发糕粉、蔓越莓干。","img":"images/639761/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"买的发糕粉里面已含了糖，不需再加其他调料，只放了些曼越莓干，起点缀作用。","img":"images/639761/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"糕粉加入180g的清水。","img":"images/639761/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌至无干粉，呈酸奶状。","img":"images/639761/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"分装至五个小碗内，八九分满。","img":"images/639761/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蔓越莓干切成碎粒，放入米浆表面。","img":"images/639761/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/639761/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"时间到，个个开花，还不错。","img":"images/639761/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。蓬松宣软，好吃！","img":"images/639761/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}